<body class="rs-page" style="margin:0;padding:0;background-color:#f3f4f6;color:#111827;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Segoe UI,Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;-webkit-text-size-adjust:100%"><div style="display:none;max-height:0;overflow:hidden;font-size:1px;line-height:1px;opacity:0;mso-hide:all">Example Outfitters passes 44 of 50 automated WCAG 2.2 AA checks.</div>
<div role="article" aria-roledescription="email" aria-label="Weekly accessibility summary for Example Outfitters" lang="en" dir="ltr" class="rs-page" style="background-color:#f3f4f6;color:#111827;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Segoe UI,Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;padding:24px 12px"><!--[if mso]><table role="presentation" align="center" width="600" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"><tr><td><![endif]-->
<div style="max-width:600px;margin:0 auto"><div class="rs-card" style="background-color:#ffffff;border:1px solid #d1d5db;border-radius:8px;padding:32px 24px"><p class="rs-text" style="margin:0 0 24px;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#111827;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.02em">Rampsmith</p>
<h1 class="rs-text" style="margin:0 0 16px;font-size:24px;line-height:32px;font-weight:700;color:#111827">Your weekly summary</h1>
<p class="rs-text" style="margin:0 0 16px;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#111827">Here is how <bdi>Example Outfitters</bdi> did in the week to <bdi>October 17, 2026</bdi>.</p>
<h2 class="rs-text" style="margin:24px 0 8px;font-size:18px;line-height:26px;font-weight:700;color:#111827">Summary</h2>
<table class="rs-text" style="width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin:0 0 16px;color:#111827"><tbody><tr><th scope="row" class="rs-row" style="padding:8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #d1d5db;vertical-align:top;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;text-align:left;font-weight:600;padding-right:16px">Automated WCAG 2.2 AA checks</th><td class="rs-row" style="padding:8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #d1d5db;vertical-align:top;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;text-align:right">Passes <bdi>44</bdi> of <bdi>50</bdi></td></tr>
<tr><th scope="row" class="rs-row" style="padding:8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #d1d5db;vertical-align:top;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;text-align:left;font-weight:600;padding-right:16px">The week before</th><td class="rs-row" style="padding:8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #d1d5db;vertical-align:top;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;text-align:right">Passes <bdi>41</bdi> of <bdi>50</bdi></td></tr>
<tr><th scope="row" class="rs-row" style="padding:8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #d1d5db;vertical-align:top;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;text-align:left;font-weight:600;padding-right:16px">New issues</th><td class="rs-row" style="padding:8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #d1d5db;vertical-align:top;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;text-align:right"><bdi>2</bdi></td></tr>
<tr><th scope="row" class="rs-row" style="padding:8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #d1d5db;vertical-align:top;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;text-align:left;font-weight:600;padding-right:16px">Issues resolved</th><td class="rs-row" style="padding:8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #d1d5db;vertical-align:top;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;text-align:right"><bdi>7</bdi></td></tr>
<tr><th scope="row" class="rs-row" style="padding:8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #d1d5db;vertical-align:top;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;text-align:left;font-weight:600;padding-right:16px">Fixes awaiting approval</th><td class="rs-row" style="padding:8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #d1d5db;vertical-align:top;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;text-align:right"><bdi>4</bdi></td></tr>
<tr><th scope="row" class="rs-row" style="padding:8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #d1d5db;vertical-align:top;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;text-align:left;font-weight:600;padding-right:16px">Next scan</th><td class="rs-row" style="padding:8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #d1d5db;vertical-align:top;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;text-align:right"><bdi>October 24, 2026</bdi></td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<h2 class="rs-text" style="margin:24px 0 8px;font-size:18px;line-height:26px;font-weight:700;color:#111827">Open issues by impact on shoppers</h2>
<table class="rs-text" style="width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin:0 0 16px;color:#111827"><tbody><tr><th scope="row" class="rs-row" style="padding:8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #d1d5db;vertical-align:top;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;text-align:left;font-weight:600;padding-right:16px">Critical</th><td class="rs-row" style="padding:8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #d1d5db;vertical-align:top;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;text-align:right"><bdi>0</bdi></td></tr>
<tr><th scope="row" class="rs-row" style="padding:8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #d1d5db;vertical-align:top;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;text-align:left;font-weight:600;padding-right:16px">Serious</th><td class="rs-row" style="padding:8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #d1d5db;vertical-align:top;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;text-align:right"><bdi>3</bdi></td></tr>
<tr><th scope="row" class="rs-row" style="padding:8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #d1d5db;vertical-align:top;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;text-align:left;font-weight:600;padding-right:16px">Moderate</th><td class="rs-row" style="padding:8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #d1d5db;vertical-align:top;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;text-align:right"><bdi>5</bdi></td></tr>
<tr><th scope="row" class="rs-row" style="padding:8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #d1d5db;vertical-align:top;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;text-align:left;font-weight:600;padding-right:16px">Minor</th><td class="rs-row" style="padding:8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #d1d5db;vertical-align:top;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;text-align:right"><bdi>2</bdi></td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<p style="margin:24px 0"><a class="rs-button" href="https://admin.shopify.com/store/fixture-store/apps/rampsmith" style="display:inline-block;background-color:#1d4ed8;border:2px solid #1d4ed8;border-radius:6px;color:#ffffff;font-size:16px;font-weight:600;line-height:24px;padding:10px 20px;text-decoration:none">Open Rampsmith</a></p>
<div class="rs-subtle" style="margin:24px 0 0;padding:12px 16px 0;background-color:#f3f4f6;border-left:4px solid #6b7280"><p class="rs-text" style="margin:0 0 12px;font-size:14px;line-height:22px;color:#111827">Automated checks find only part of all accessibility issues. Rampsmith lists what it checked and what still needs a person to review.</p>
<p class="rs-text" style="margin:0 0 12px;font-size:14px;line-height:22px;color:#111827">Deque, the maker of axe-core, reports that axe-core finds on average 57% of WCAG issues automatically.</p>
</div>
